  "descriptionProcessing": "- The total energy supply is extended to countries not covered by the Statistical Review using the U.S. Energy Information Administration's (EIA) total energy consumption. The Statistical Review is prioritized where both sources are available.\n- The World series is extended back to 1800 using Vaclav Smil's historical estimates (2017), for years before the Statistical Review begins (1965). Only commercially-traded energy sources are included (traditional biomass, which Smil reports but the Statistical Review does not, is excluded so the series stays on a single basis with no step at the splice).",
